# Operator-rendered overrides (if any per-env values are
# generated similarly to homelab-infra's bootstrap-templating
# pattern). Source-of-truth is the .j2 sibling.
#
# Note: rendered files in homelab-k8s ARE committed (Argo
# reads from git). Unlike homelab-infra, where bootstrap apply
# reads from operator's local filesystem and rendered outputs
# are gitignored.
**/*.rendered.yaml

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Helm dependency caches
**/charts/

# Argo CD's local cache (if operator runs `argocd app diff`
# locally with --local)
.argocd-cache/
